hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"342","Fatah ke waqt kya kaha jaye us ke bare mein bab: Hannad ibn al-Sari ne hum se bayan kiya, Muhammad ibn Ubayd ne hum se bayan kiya, Hilal ibn Salman se; maine al-Sha'bi ko kehte hue suna: Jab (Jab Allah ki madad aur fatah aa jaye) nazil hui to Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ko jab bhi fatah ata hoti to farmate: Subhanallah, Alhamdulillah, main Allah ki taraf ruju karta hun aur Us se bakhshish mangta hun."
